  startingNodeID: Greeting
  nodes:
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Greeting
    nextNodeID: choices0
    text: "Here to see marvelous art? You came to the right place, stranger. My potteries
      are the epitome of life. Look at the vibrance breathing\u2026"
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Kerameos
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: choices0
    nextNodeID: 
    text: 
    choices:
    - text: I might not understand fully, but your pottery is truly unique.
      nextNodeID: Sigh
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    - text: "Sorry, I\u2019m not here for that."
      nextNodeID: Sigh
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Sigh
    nextNodeID: Hurt
    text: How could I have ever brought myself to think that a young lad like you
      would understand my intent. Oh, look at the time! I have pottery to fix.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Kerameos
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Hurt
    nextNodeID: choices1
    text: Of course, dumb Artopoios broke his pots and hurt himself. Stranger, am
      I not so generous to work in his favor?
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Kerameos
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: choices1
    nextNodeID: 
    text: 
    choices:
    - text: Not really.
      nextNodeID: Nonsense
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    - text: "It\u2019s your job."
      nextNodeID: Nonsense
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 1
    id: Nonsense
    nextNodeID: 
    text: Absurd! Remove yourself from my presence.
    choices: []
